Thank you.

171
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,400
好了 又赚了48块钱
Okay, so that's 48 more dollars.

172
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:35,240
-我们只需要... -再有72只猫死就行了
- Now, all we need is - For 72 more cats to die.

173
00:07:36,140 --> 00:07:38,220
麦克斯 别这样乱咒猫嘛
Max, there's no need to kill imaginary cats.

174
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,900
我们只需多发送正面能量
Let's just send out positive energy,

175
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:41,100
老天爷就会安排好的
and the universe will provide.

176
00:07:42,820 --> 00:07:44,180
失手了啊 老天爷
Swing and a miss, universe.

177
00:07:46,180 --> 00:07:47,880
给你们惊喜 我刚好来附近
Surprise! I was in the neighborhood

178
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,380
就想着过来打声招呼
and thought I'd stop by and say hello.

179
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:52,280
平常呢 我会说"不准你再不请自来"
Under any other circumstance, I'd say, "never do that again,"

180
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,680
但今天特别 所以"你要买多少小蛋糕呢"
But today, I'm saying, "how many cupcakes do you want""

181
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,500
我觉得就来个10到20个吧
And I'm thinking of a number between 10 and 20.

182
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,500
我想看着我的腰[照顾体重]呢
I'm kind of trying to watch my waist.

183
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:01,520
你的头已经比别人更近腰了
Well, you're closer to it than most people.

184
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,940
就先给你来个12个小蛋糕吧
I'm gonna start you with 12 cupcakes.

185
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:08,720
你算家人 就"原价"招待吧
Full price, 'cause you're family.

186
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:12,340
天啊 一边有顾客上门
Oh, my God! The phone ringing

187
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,020
一边还有顾客打来
and a customer at the same time?

188
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,420
麦克斯 我们的好运到啦
See, Max, it's all happening.

189
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:17,060
我们昨晚赚到的钱
Between the money we just got last night

190
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:19,300
加怀胎少女的成年礼与迎婴派对
and that pregnant girl's Quinceanera / Baby shower,

191
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,360
绝对能赚到租金啊
we're gonna make our rent.

192
00:08:20,373 --> 00:08:22,460
麦克斯自制小蛋糕
Max's Homemade Cupcakes.

193
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:23,660
你好啊 埃斯特拉[西语]
Oh, hola, Estella.

194
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,540
是的 成年礼加迎婴派对
Si, the Quinceanera / Baby shower.

195
00:08:26,230 --> 00:08:28,060
怎么了
Que?

196
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:29,260
不是吧 遣返
Oh, no. Deported?

197
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,620
哦 是付不起啊
Oh, you can't afford it.

198
00:08:37,570 --> 00:08:39,762
我听错了
My mal.

199
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:42,780
很遗憾未能为你服务 感谢来电
Well, sorry, it didn't work out. Gracias for calling.

200
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:45,060
这下失望了吧
Well, that's disappointing,

201
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,240
不过我们早该料到有这下场
but we should have seen it coming.

202
00:08:46,340 --> 00:08:47,620
她连避孕套都买不起
She couldn't afford condoms either.

203
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,000
没事
It's cool.

204
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,120
我再打给琦芙吧
I'll just call Keefer

205
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:54,120
帮她多外送几趟就行了
and try to do a couple more cupcake runs.

206
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:56,440
不许这样 这太冒险了
No, that's not cool, that's dangerous.

207
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:58,740
船到桥头自然直 这样吧
It'll all work out. You know what?

208
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,320
我这就过去问安迪
I'm just gonna go over and ask Andy

209
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:02,840
借点钱周转 节日高峰期过后就能还他了
if he'll float us some cash till the holiday rush kicks in.

210
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:03,840
他也说过要借啊
He did offer.

211
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,840
我们也应该挂上圣诞灯
We should put up some Christmas lights,

212
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,440
犹太光明节的烛台 以及宽扎节的...
a menorah for Chanukah, and for Kwanzaa...

213
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,940
我去的时候 你搜搜宽扎节摆饰吧
While I'm gone, why don't you Wikipedia Kwanzaa?

214
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,380
好了 先上八个给你
Well... Here's the first eight.

215
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,140
你还想外带多少个小蛋糕走呢
And how many cupcakes would you like "to go"?

216
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,940
我觉得就来个40到50个吧
I'm thinking of a number between 40 and 50.

217
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:23,400
你在餐馆的时候怎么不这么推销食物啊
How come you never push the food at the diner like this?

218
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,680
对哦 我是在那里认识你的啊
Oh, that's where I know you from.

219
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:29,800
快开吃吧
Start eating.

220
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,420
我没问他借
I didn't do it.

221
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:40,620
这样太不性感了 他是我男朋友呢
It's so not hot. He's my boyfriend.

222
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:42,600
没办法像跟亲人借钱那样自然
I mean, it's not like borrowing money from family.

223
00:09:42,660 --> 00:09:44,160
毕竟我们又不跟自己家人"睡"
You don't sleep with your family.

224
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:47,440
有些家庭就不是这样呢 卡洛琳
Not all families are the same, Caroline.

225
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:51,560
而且 我们没事的 老天爷会照顾我们
Besides, we're fine. The universe will provide.

226
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,760
那老天爷最好是这几秒内
Well, the universe better provide in,

227
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:55,460
赶紧照顾我们啊 房东来了
like, a second, 'cause look, there's the landlord.

228
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,940
他已经到斜对面摩洛哥店了
He just went into that Moroccan place.

229
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:57,980
我们该怎么办
What are we gonna do?

230
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,360
-躲啊 -什么
- Hide! - What?

231
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:00,980
好了 我该走了
Well, I should go.

232
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,620
想走已经太迟了
It's too late for that!

233
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:03,840
锁门 关灯
Lock the door, hit the lights,

234
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,560
爬过来 蹲下身子
and crawl over here, and stay low!

235
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,600
在他看不见前 不要起身
Stay down till we're out of sight.

236
00:10:09,140 --> 00:10:12,460
膝盖好疼哦
Ow, it hurts!

237
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:14,800
拜托 说得像这是
Oh, please. Like this is the first time

238
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:15,660
你第一次在厕所里"跪地抬臀"一样
you've been on your knees in the bathroom.

239
00:10:17,620 --> 00:10:19,280
卡洛琳 进来就不用趴地上了啊
Caroline, you don't have to stay on the ground anymore.

240
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:21,660
我觉得我现在低等得只配趴地上
I feel like this is where I belong now.

241
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,700
烘焙女孩们
Yo, baker girls.

242
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,160
麦克斯 他进店了
Max, he's in the shop.

243
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,200
-好吧 爬窗吧 -你说真的吗
- Okay, go, out the window. - Really?

244
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,180
他要是没见到我们 就不能赶走我们
If he can't see us, he can't evict us.

245
00:10:30,180 --> 00:10:30,500
快啊
Go.

246
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,620
有点高耶 你确定吗
It's a little high. Are you sure?

247
00:10:36,060 --> 00:10:38,460
你听过"当上帝关上门 他也开一扇窗"吧
You've heard "when God closes a door, he opens a window"?

248
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,320
他当时就是在躲房东
He's running from his landlord.

249
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:40,780
跳吧
Go.

250
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:43,660
好吧 我跳啦
Okay, here goes.

251
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,440
麦克斯 我爱你
I love you, Max.

252
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:49,500
那我呢 我怎么办
What about me? What should I do?

253
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,260
把小蛋糕的钱放柜台上
Put the money for those cupcakes on the counter.

254
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,700
你是谁啊
Who are you?

255
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,040
"偶不东英文"
No hablo ingles?

256
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:07,600
好了 好消息
All right, all right, good news.

257
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,720
我刚在我口袋发现3块钱
I just found $3 in my pocket.

258
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,820
还有一颗M&M花生巧克力豆
Oh, and a peanut M&M,

259
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,480
我们今晚不必花钱吃晚餐啦
so we don't have to spend money on dinner.

260
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,000
卡洛琳 别再闪躲了
Caroline, why are you putting it off?

261
00:11:16,060 --> 00:11:17,360
该干嘛你自己知道
You know what you have to do.

262
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,620
乖乖伸手去掏沙发缝吧
Go over to the couch and put your hands in that crack.

263
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,660
每个穷姑娘都躲不过这件事
It's every poor girl's rite of passage.

264
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,120
怎么了
What?

265
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,200
感觉有东西舔了我一下
I think something just licked me.

266
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:32,640
我检查我们的钱包吧 这是你的
I'll just check our purses. Here's yours.

267
00:11:32,780 --> 00:11:34,040
不用不用 我已经检查过了
Uh, no, no, no. I already checked that.

268
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,120
我的钱包里没东西...
There's nothing in mine...

269
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:36,700
只有一袋大麻
Except that baggie of pot

270
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,220
那是琦芙送我的圣诞礼物
that Keefer gave me as a Christmas present.

271
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,960
麦克斯 这不是什么圣诞礼物
Max, this is not a Christmas present.

272
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:43,500
这是满满一大袋的非法大麻
This is a giant, illegal, fat sack of weed.

273
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:46,360
对啊 可上面有个麋鹿贴纸
Yeah, with a Rudolph sticker,

274
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,860
所以这是圣诞礼物啦
which makes it a Christmas present.

275
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:50,880
看见没 他的红鼻子和红眼睛多喜庆
See? His nose and his eyes are red.

276
00:11:52,020 --> 00:11:54,560
我不想看见这玩意 你得让它消失
I want this out of my sight. You gotta get rid of it.

277
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,300
我抽完这满满一袋
Well, it's gonna take me

278
00:11:56,300 --> 00:11:58,340
至少得花45分钟呢
at least 45 minutes to smoke all that.

279
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,160
麦克斯 我是说真的
Max, I'm serious,

280
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,540
我看着这满满一袋大麻觉得很别扭
I'm not comfortable with that fat sack of weed.

281
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:05,080
别再用"满满一袋"这个词
Stop saying "fat sack of weed."

282
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:07,600
你就像那种学了潮流词就猛用的中年父亲
You're like someone's dad overusing the word "awesome."

283
00:12:09,060 --> 00:12:10,260
我把它放上面吧
I'll just put it up here,

284
00:12:10,260 --> 00:12:14,100
放在我留着新年嗑的半颗维柯丁[止痛药]旁边
next to the half a Vicodin I was saving for new year's.

285
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,360
别啊 我的大麻
Oh, no! The pot!

286
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:18,820
我的大麻掉进锅里了
The pot is in the pot!

287
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:20,800
掉到我要用来做小蛋糕的那锅黄油里了
It's in the butter I was using to make cupcakes.

288
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,520
也许这是老天爷的旨意
Maybe this is the universe's way

289
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,340
让你不要跟毒品沾边
of telling you to stop doing drugs.

290
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:27,160
或是在指引我们拿去卖掉
Or is it telling us to sell them?

291
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:32,880
麦克斯 我们没穷到那个地步
Max, we are not that desperate.

292
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,280
我们不用做大麻小蛋糕的
We're not making pot cupcakes.

293
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:36,180
我宁愿期待节日会带来什么惊喜
I'd rather just see what the holidays bring.

294
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:38,780
这里不是伯利恒 这里是布鲁克林
Well, this isn't Bethlehem, it's Brooklyn.

295
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:40,540
这里既没乳香 也无没药
There's no frankincense and myrrh,

296
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:42,040
这里只有"屌香"和"大麻药"
there's only frankenberry and "Myrrh-ajuana."

297
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,860
做出来结果很棒
These turned out great!

298
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,980
好主意 啊 老天爷
Good idea, universe.

299
00:12:54,060 --> 00:12:55,280
我早就知道你也是麻友了
I knew you smoked weed.

300
00:12:56,900 --> 00:12:59,259
天啊 这味道太难闻了吧
Oh, my God. I can't believe the smell.

301
00:12:59,259 --> 00:13:02,475
像臭鼬被另一只臭鼬喷了臭气似地
It's like a skunk skunked a skunk.

302
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:04,080
我明白 就像狂欢会过后的
I know. It's like a port-a-potty

303
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,760
公共厕所一样臭
on the last day of Coachella.

304
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,860
惨了 栗宝在偷吸
Oh, no, Chestnut's smelling this.

305
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,320
我家小马都成毒虫了
I got my horse stoned.

306
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:12,800
别这么紧张
Oh, relax.

307
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,480
他只是想打入其他同学的圈子嘛
He's just trying to fit in at school.

308
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:18,300
你觉得邻居会闻到这味吗
Do you think the neighbors can smell it?

309
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:19,640
他们会不会打给警察举报我们啊
Do you think they're gonna call the cops?

310
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:20,780
别这么紧张啦
Chill out!

311
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:23,320
怎么有人还没能抽嗨 就这么多疑啊[副作用]
How can someone be this paranoid before they're high?

312
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:25,880
来 尝尝看
Here, taste this.

313
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,460
麦克斯 我才不碰大麻
Max, I don't do pot.

314
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,080
我大学的时候试过几次
I tried it a couple times in college.

315
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,680
会害我性格起大变化
It totally changed my personality.

316
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,560
那求你快吃了这大麻小蛋糕吧
Then please have some pot right now.

317
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:36,240
这是为了生意好吗
Come on, it's business.

318
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:38,140
得有人尝尝 告诉我味道如何啊
I need you to taste it and tell me how it is,

319
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,660
我现在尝不出来 做完这些
'cause I can't tell. At this point,

320
00:13:39,660 --> 00:13:41,460
味道浓得我吃什么都会像大麻
everything I put in my mouth tastes like pot.

321
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:46,320
还不错呢
Hey, it's pretty good.

322
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:49,720
其实这味道蛮好吃的呢
In fact, it's kind of delicious.

323
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:53,380
我们应该收人家15块钱一个
We should charge 15 apiece for these.

324
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,540
这样能赚540块 刚好交租
That's $540. That's our rent.

325
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:57,520
你要是再多吃几口
A few more bites of that cupcake,

326
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,420
你就得多花两小时才算得出刚才的东西了
and that math would've taken two hours longer.

327
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:03,120
惨了 条子来了
Oh, my God! It's the cops!

328
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,040
估计就是上次那队特警
It's probably that same SWAT team!

329
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,980
我都说了让你别跟毒品沾边
I told you not to get involved with drugs!

330
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:08,400
我早告诉过你了
I told you!

331
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:11,200
闭嘴 卡洛琳 闭嘴
Shut it, Caroline! Shut it!

332
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,800
别紧张 是苏菲啦
Relax, it's Sophie.

333
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:17,040
姑娘们 我月经来了
Hi, girls. I got my period.

334
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,680
肚子疼得要死
Yeah, I got killer cramps.

335
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:22,720
像我子宫里有台拖拉机在乱搅一样
It's like I got a tractor in my uterus.

336
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:25,740
苏菲 你不舒服我们也很遗憾
Sophie, we're sorry you're not feeling well.

337
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:28,740
这种时候总让我觉得 老天爷真贱
Yeah, you know, it's times like these I think God's a bitch.

338
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:34,060
慢着 慢着
Wait a minute, wait a minute.

339
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,920
那是什么味道
What's that smell?

340
